{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","is_bot":false,"login":"iquerejeta","name":"Iñigo Querejeta Azurmendi"},"baseRefName":"ledger-10","body":"## Description\r\n\r\nAdds a verify_proof instruction to ZKIR-v3 that verifies an inner proof in-circuit via midnight-zk's verifier gadget.\r\n\r\n## Sanity Checklist\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n- [x] contains changes to transaction behaviour [^1]\r\n- [ ] contains changes to architecture [^1]\r\n- [ ] contains breaking API changes [^1][^2]\r\n- [ ] contains data format changes [^1]\r\n- [ ] contains circuit behaviour changes [^3]\r\n- [ ] requires a backport to prior versions\r\n- [ ] is primarily authored by AI\r\n- [x] I have self-reviewed the PR diff\r\n- [ ] changelog and package versions have been amended, or don't require it\r\n- [ ] has ignored the checklist\r\n\r\n## Details\r\n\r\n* VK is stored by hash. The instruction holds only `hash(vk)` (of the VK blob); the full VK is resolved out-of-band into `IrSource.verify_proof_vks`. This keeps the VK out of the canonical IR. keygen/prove check that the resolved blob hashes to `vk_hash` and fail fast otherwise.\r\n* Proof is a witness. The inner proof lives in `ProofPreimage.proof_witnesses`, consumed positionally.\r\n* Public inputs constrained in statement order (load-bearing). `verify_proof` exposes the inner accumulator mid-synthesis and records its offset from the live public-input counter; the offset only matches the statement vector if every PI is constrained in order.\r\n* ZKIR forwards the opaque vk_blob, instance and proof to midnight-zk's byte entry points.\r\n* Verification; a single verify runs the Plonk check and the inner proof's deferred pairing.\r\n\r\n\r\n[^1]: If any of these are true, target a future release instead of the default branch.\r\n[^2]: Exceptions may be considered on a case-to-case basis where the impact is minimal.\r\n[^3]: Ensure that these changes are backwards-compatible.# Overview\r\n","closedAt":"2026-09-03T08:51:00Z","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-07-23T10:08:20Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:27:50Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Change ProofPreimage constructor","oid":"81370ccc48fca45777b0927724a25ae89e99987c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T09:52:21Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:27:50Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add accumulator offsets, and finalise them on call to verify","oid":"1aedaee4fbe956e8f236774637fc6ee6199f9fa5"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T10:01:52Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:29:03Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add the verify proof instruction","oid":"3eac8ca1abb001228b78155fab5a4194e8126cef"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T09:25:02Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:29:03Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add tests using verify_proof","oid":"06e4bcbff8c35a8c63a675cab965c8a8b0184c96"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T10:13:03Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:29:52Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Cargo lock","oid":"146ca34ec075914a3b5c75fb4c376f9f34ee76a2"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-17T09:12:38Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjczNzc0","login":"iquerejeta","name":"iquerejeta"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:29:52Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add instruction to get proof from","oid":"1d2fb1c593fc0a2db15877eda63108508b50704d"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-19T08:29:14Z","authors":[{"email":"querejeta.azurmendi@iohk.io","id":"